# M1_limitation_pileup_ML.xps -- runs M1_limitation_pileup_ML.ode in one go (the steps at the top of the .ode).
#   XPPAUT 8.4:  File > Do script > M1_limitation_pileup_ML.xps    (or: xppaut M1_limitation_pileup_ML.ode -script M1_limitation_pileup_ML.xps)
#   XPPAUT-Web:  pick it under Scripts (group iso-test), or open the link with ?script=
speed 0.3
msg "M1 near the equilibrium x* = (-23.09182, 0.1580528): a box 2 by 0.02, coloured by phase"
keys v 2
ans X-axis=vs|Y-axis=ws|Xmin=-24.09182|Ymin=0.1480528|Xmax=-22.09182|Ymax=0.1680528|Xlabel=v|Ylabel=w
keys u c a
ans theta
ans c
ans 0
ans 1
keys esc
keys i 2
ans Vary1=vs|Start1=-24.09182|End1=-22.09182|Vary2=ws|Start2=0.1480528|End2=0.1680528|Steps=40|Steps2=40|Reset storage (Y/N)=N|Use old ic's (Y/N)=Y|Cycle color (Y/N)=N|Movie(Y/N)=N|Crv(1) Array(2)=2
keys n n
msg "Every phase (every colour) in this small box; the nullclines cross at x*. Next: a box 10 times smaller, in a new window"
wait 4
keys m c
keys u c a
ans theta
ans c
ans 0
ans 1
keys esc
keys v 2
ans X-axis=vs|Y-axis=ws|Xmin=-23.19182|Ymin=0.1570528|Xmax=-22.99182|Ymax=0.1590528|Xlabel=v|Ylabel=w
keys i 2
ans Vary1=vs|Start1=-23.19182|End1=-22.99182|Vary2=ws|Start2=0.1570528|End2=0.1590528|Steps=40|Steps2=40|Reset storage (Y/N)=N|Use old ic's (Y/N)=Y|Cycle color (Y/N)=N|Movie(Y/N)=N|Crv(1) Array(2)=2
keys n n
msg "Done. M1's limitation: every phase sits next to x*, however small the box, so no grid can draw the isochrons there."
